Third-party software
--------------------
Kaizeval depends on third-party open-source packages that are installed separately and remain
under their own licenses. The list and licenses of the Python dependencies are recorded in
docs/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, and those of the web console in web/package.json.

The sample knowledge documents under src/kaizeval/sample_agent/kb describe a fictional company
and were written for this project.
